### Desk Companion Assistant API smoke tests
### Use with VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP Client
###
### Local Ollama tunnel setup:
### 1. Keep SSH tunnel open:
###    ssh -L 11434:localhost:11434 desk_companion@100.119.136.81
### 2. Start local Spring Boot backend with:
###    $env:OLLAMA_BASE_URL="http://localhost:11434"
###    # ASSISTANT_SERVICE_URL is also accepted as an alias.
###    $env:OLLAMA_MODEL="qwen2.5:7b"
###    $env:OLLAMA_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS="120"
###    $env:OLLAMA_CHAT_NUM_PREDICT="96"
###    # decide now uses a slim JSON contract ({mode,intent,confidence,minutes});
###    # defaults are OLLAMA_DECIDE_NUM_PREDICT=48, OLLAMA_DECIDE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=120.
###    # If you previously set OLLAMA_DECIDE_NUM_PREDICT=16/25 in this shell,
###    # clear it first or the JSON will truncate again:
###    #   Remove-Item Env:OLLAMA_DECIDE_NUM_PREDICT
###    mvn spring-boot:run

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Phase 1 chat-only smoke test
# @name assistantChat
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "請只回覆一句繁體中文：連線成功。"
}

### 2. Phase 1 chat with app context
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我現在讀書讀到有點累，你會怎麼陪我？",
  "context": {
    "pomodoro": {
      "status": "running",
      "remainingSeconds": 900
    },
    "vision": {
      "state": "fatigue_detected"
    },
    "todaySummary": {
      "focusMinutes": 45,
      "completedPomodoros": 2
    }
  }
}

### 3. Phase 1 chat with short history
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "那幫我用一句話鼓勵我。",
  "history": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "我今天想專心準備期末專題。"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "好，我會陪你把注意力放回最重要的一步。"
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Future Phase 2 reference: user asks for an app action
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "幫我開一個 25 分鐘番茄鐘"
}

### 5. Phase 2 decide: clear app action
# @name assistantDecideAction
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/decide
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "幫我開一個 25 分鐘番茄鐘",
  "context": {
    "pomodoro": {
      "status": "idle"
    }
  }
}

### 6. Phase 2 decide: ambiguous request should clarify
# @name assistantDecideClarify
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/decide
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "幫我一下，我快不行了",
  "context": {
    "pomodoro": {
      "status": "running",
      "remainingSeconds": 600
    },
    "vision": {
      "state": "fatigue_detected"
    }
  }
}

### 7. Phase 2 decide: pure chat should not bind a tool
# @name assistantDecideChat
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/decide
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我今天讀書有點挫折，可以鼓勵我一下嗎？"
}

### 8. Phase 2 decide: deliberately avoids every decideWithLocalRules() keyword
### so this one actually has to go through Ollama's format:"json" path.
### Use this to measure decide()'s real latency, not the local-rule shortcut.
# @name assistantDecideForceOllama
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant/decide
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我今天心情普普通通，還沒決定接下來要做什麼"
}
